"entity": {
"name": "UGI Corporation",
"description": "UGI Corp. is a holding company, which engages in the distribution, transportation, storing, and marketing of energy products and services. It operates through the following segments: AmeriGas Propane, UGI International, Midstream and Marketing, and Utilities. The AmeriGas Propane segment consists of the propane distribution business of AmeriGas Partners. The UGI International segment focuses on LPG distribution businesses conducted by its subsidiaries and affiliates. The Midstream and Marketing segment is involved in energy-related businesses through its wholly owned subsidiary, Energy Services. The Utilities segment includes the natural gas and electricity distribution of businesses directly and through its wholly owned subsidiaries. The company was founded on June 1, 1882, and is headquartered in King of Prussia, PA.",
